  "body": "Change two occurrences of (roughly):\r\n```\r\nIf x is a match for one of the strings in the following list,\r\n    then run the substeps that follow:\r\n    [list of strings]\r\nThe substeps are:\r\n    [substeps]\r\n```\r\nto:\r\n```\r\nIf x is a match for one of the strings in the following list:\r\n     [list of strings]\r\nthen:\r\n    [substeps]\r\n```\r\nas the latter seems more common. (E.g., scan `source` for `/<p>then/`.)",
